, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Pricing Grid</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#111111] text-zinc-200 font-['Inter',sans-serif] antialiased selection:bg-zinc-800 selection:text-white flex flex-col min-h-screen relative z-0 overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n  <!-- Container Lines -->\n  <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-[-1] flex justify-center\">\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1400px] h-full border-x border-zinc-800/60 relative\">\n      <div class=\"absolute top-0 -left-[3px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-zinc-700 bg-[#111111]\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute top-0 -right-[3px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-zinc-700 bg-[#111111]\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -left-[3px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-zinc-700 bg-[#111111]\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -right-[3px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-zinc-700 bg-[#111111]\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div 